---
import { OPPORTUNITY_PILLS } from '../../lib/const';
import Badge from '../ui/badge.astro';
import Button from '../ui/button.astro';
import Arrow from '../ui/icons/arrow.astro';
---

<section id='lavoro' class='relative'>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/gradient-bg.webp')] bg-cover bg-bottom"></div>

  <div class='relative p-container flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center'>
    <div class='flex flex-col items-center gap-4'>
      <Badge variant='dark-yellow'> Opportunità </Badge>

      <h2 class='text-white'>Le occasioni di lavoro nascono dentro alla community, non fuori.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class='flex flex-col gap-7.5 rounded-3xl bg-white/10 lg:flex-row p-6 lg:px-13.5 lg:py-11.5'>
      <img src='/images/people-gathering.webp' class='object-cover rounded-[14px]' />

      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 h-full text-sm text-[#161219]'>
        {
          OPPORTUNITY_PILLS.map((pill) => (
            <div class='flex items-center gap-4 rounded-[14px] border border-[#0B0B0E17] bg-white p-3.5'>
              <img src={pill.icon} alt='' width='50' height='50' class='size-12.5 shrink-0' />
              <p class='font-semibold'>{pill.text}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class='max-w-3xl text-white/80'>
      Con l’accesso Pro sblocchi una bacheca dedicata dove i membri pubblicano e trovano collaborazioni tra
      professionisti, clienti in cerca di professionisti e posizioni aperte nella community.
    </p>

    <Button
      href='https://www.skool.com/productized-services-italia-4079/about'
      target='_blank'
      rel='noopener noreferrer'
      class='mt-2'>Entra nella community <Arrow /></Button
    >
  </div>
</section>
